ult":"","toolDurationMs":"0","toolErrorCode":"","childBoardId":"","spiritSessionId":"","teamId":"","dagNodeId":"","dependsOnJson":"[]","agentKey":"session-service","agentName":"会话状态","collapsed":false,"label":"","promptTokens":"0","completionTokens":"0","seq":"0","metaJson":"{\"notice_type\":\"success\",\"session_id\":\"d1ffb2f5-8730-4cb9-81cf-a819700422bb\",\"status\":\"completed\",\"status_changed_at\":\"2026-06-30T04:41:09Z\",\"status_reason\":\"\"}"},{"id":"726a82a0-26fb-40b1-8e11-1c6c5200b62a","kind":"task","status":"completed","sessionId":"d1ffb2f5-8730-4cb9-81cf-a819700422bb","turnId":"14afd869-890f-4c96-acd5-7d24b3288c72","parentActivityId":"","timestamp":"2026-06-30T04:41:02.1049957Z","durationMs":"7585","content":"模拟数据分析 (Simulation Data Analysis)","reasoning":"","toolName":"","toolCallId":"","toolArguments":"","toolResult":"","toolDurationMs":"0","toolErrorCode":"","childBoardId":"","spiritSessionId":"5e563bb1-8526-407d-95f3-a70ef0330507","teamId":"fffaa0bc74c52c68e24cba5e","dagNodeId":"","dependsOnJson":"[]","agentKey":"ca2a9d6d91c20fdc15a0d250","agentName":"研发助手","collapsed":false,"label":"","promptTokens":"454","completionTokens":"569","seq":"0","metaJson":"{\"usage\":{\"completion_tokens\":569,\"prompt_tokens\":454,\"total_tokens\":1023}}"},{"id":"8592dc11-b7ee-40b2-932c-3ac6d34eacc3","kind":"plan","status":"running","sessionId":"d1ffb2f5-8730-4cb9-81cf-a819700422bb","turnId":"14afd869-890f-4c96-acd5-7d24b3288c72","parentActivityId":"e5e8d737-278d-5e61-b10f-eb93a2e18c91","timestamp":"2026-06-30T04:41:02.2207585Z","durationMs":"0","content":"执行计划","reasoning":"","toolName":"","toolCallId":"","toolArguments":"","toolResult":"","toolDurationMs":"0","toolErrorCode":"","childBoardId":"","spiritSessionId":"","teamId":"","dagNodeId":"","dependsOnJson":"[]","agentKey":"","agentName":"","collapsed":false,"label":"","promptTokens":"0","completionTokens":"0","seq":"0","metaJson":"{\"steps\":[{\"id\":\"member-1\",\"label\":\"Agent · member-1\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"id\":\"member-1\",\"label\":\"Agent · member-1\",\"status\":\"running\"}]}"},{"id":"ef8a9706-f769-4b5c-92fd-cb83f34c3a39","kind":"thinking","status":"completed","sessionId":"d1ffb2f5-8730-4cb9-81cf-a819700422bb","turnId":"14afd869-890f-4c96-acd5-7d24b3288c72","parentActivityId":"e5e8d737-278d-5e61-b10f-eb93a2e18c91","timestamp":"2026-06-30T04:41:02.7391174Z","durationMs":"6941","content":"","reasoning":"我们被问到\"模拟数据分析 (Simulation Data Analysis)\"，这看起来像是一个中文请求，可能希望我们讨论或解释模拟数据分析的概念、方法或应用。用户可能想要一个概述或指导。由于这是第一次交互，我应该以友好、专业的方式回应，提供有价值的见解。\n\n考虑到我是研发助手，专注于架构、代码质量、测试与可维护性，所以我可以从仿真数据管理的角度，或者从数据科学中模拟数据的分析出发。用户没有给出具体上下文。我可能需要假设一个通用场景。\n\n最佳回应：解释模拟数据分析，并建议如何在我关注的领域应用（如架构设计、测试等）。同时遵守AGENTS_CORE：使用用户语言（中文），先理解意图。由于用户只给出了短语，我可以主动询问具体需求或直接提供概述。\n\n我决定先给出一个简洁的概述，然后引导用户说出更具体的需求。","toolName":"","toolCallId":"","toolArguments":"","toolResult":"","toolDurationMs":"0","toolErrorCode":"","childBoardId":"","spiritSessionId":"5e563bb1-8526-407d-95f3-a70ef0330507","teamId":"fffaa0bc74c52c68e24cba5e","dagNodeId":"","dependsOnJson":"[]","agentKey":"programmer","agentName":"研发助手","collapsed":true,"label":"推理","promptTokens":"0","completionTokens":"0","seq":"0","metaJson":""},{"id":"8a41e2d2-d287-4ecb-ae6b-420d5d6473c9","kind":"reply","status":"completed","sessionId":"d1ffb2f5-8730-4cb9-81cf-a819700422bb","turnId":"14afd869-890f-4c96-acd5-7d24b3288c72","parentActivityId":"e5e8d737-278d-5e61-b10f-eb93a2e18c91","timestamp":"2026-06-30T04:41:04.8244296Z","durationMs":"4856","content":"### 模拟数据分析（Simulation Data Analysis）概述\n\n模拟数据分析是指对通过仿真（Simulation）生成的数据进行收集、整理、可视化和推断的过程。在研发领域，模拟常用于替代成本过高、风险过大或无法直接实验的场景，例如：\n\n- 物理系统（CFD、FEA、电磁场）\n- 电路与芯片设计（SPICE、时序仿真）\n- 随机过程（蒙特卡洛、排队论）\n- 软件性能（分布式系统调度、负载测试）\n\n分析这类数据时，核心挑战在于：\n\n1. **数据特性**：模拟往往产生大批量（TB 级）时间序列或网格数据，你需要高效的存储格式（HDF5, Parquet）和采样策略。\n2. **验证与校准**：模拟结果需与理论解或少量实测值对比，量化误差（如 NMSE、相对偏差）。\n3. **不确定性量化**：输入参数随机分布时，输出需给出置信区间或灵敏度排序。\n4. **可重现性**：模拟参数、随机种子、软件版本都要记录，否则分析结论不可靠。\n\n### 从我（研发工程师）角度的实践建议\n\n- **架构上**：将模拟数据流水线设计为可配置的管道（配置 -> 运行 -> 后处理），避免硬编码路径和参数。\n- **代码质量**：为后处理脚本增加单元测试（用已知解析解作为 baseline），防止重构引入误差。\n- **可维护性**：使用离线查询引擎（如 DuckDB、Dask）替代逐文件加载，降低内存压力。输出结果默认附带元数据（模拟时间戳、版本 hash）。\n\n如果你能进一步说明你具体关注的模拟类型（如数值仿真、蒙特卡洛、Agent-based、网络仿真）或行业背景（金融、自动驾驶、芯片验证），我可以给出更针对的技术方案或分析步骤。","reasoning":"","toolName":"","toolCallId":"","toolArguments":"","toolResult":"","toolDurationMs":"0","toolErrorCode":"","childBoardId":"","spiritSessionId":"5e563bb1-8526-407d-95f3-a70ef0330507","teamId":"fffaa0bc74c52c68e24cba5e","dagNodeId":"","dependsOnJson":"[]","agentKey":"programmer","agentName":"研发助手","collapsed":false,"label":"","promptTokens":"0","completionTokens":"0","seq":"0","metaJson":"{\"is_final\":true,\"member_id\":\"programmer\"}"}]}